(
    title: "Basic Math",
    developer: Some("Gary Palmer"),
    description: Some("Atari\'s early arithmetic teacher, later reissued as Fun with Numbers. The console sets problems in the four operations — addition, subtraction, multiplication and division — and you dial in each answer with the joystick against a running tally. The cartridge offers both ordered \"table\" problems, which drill a chosen number in sequence, and mixed \"random\" ones."),
